OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers will continue through the
OL,7,Fevening, these heavy and thundery in
OL,8,Fplaces. These showers will slowly ease
OL,9,Fovernight but the odd one will linger
OL,10,Funtil dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA cloudy start with a few
OL,13,Fshowers, perhaps heavy in places.
OL,14,FBecoming mainly dry and bright by the
OL,15,Fafternoon but some rain will spread
OL,16,Finto the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
